  "description": "A good guard bar not only protects the vehicle but also makes it look better. This anti-rust bull bar provides you with the following: Front end protection; A new look for your vehicle; A skid plate that gives your undercarriage extra protection.\nFitment\n2007-2021 Toyota Tundra\n2008-2022 Toyota Sequoia\nFeatures\nDurable and Safe\nThe push bar is made up of a 3\" heavy duty tubing frame that offers supreme durability and strength; e-coating and black powder coating are applied for rust resistance; Seamlessly welded for a smooth appearance.\nThoughtful Design\nFeatures pre-drilled holes so you can easily add additional lighting; The anti-rust skid plate can be removed; Exquisitely crafted with a bolder look in mind.\nEasy Installation\n100% bolt-on installation, no drilling required. Installation can be done easily in a home garage using common tools. (All mounting hardware and installation instructions are included.)\nProfessional Customer Service\nBull bar may interfere with forward-facing cameras or sensors. If you receive a product with dents and scratches on the surface, or have any hardware and brackets missing; or have any questions about the installation. Please feel free to contact us\nFor your safety, professional installation recommended",
